## Pre-Deployment Review

Before production deployment:
1. Check security level in SECURITY.md
2. Complete security-review.md checklist
3. Run `npm audit` and check dependencies.md
4. Update SECURITY.md review status

## Compliance Checks

### If GDPR
- [ ] Data inventory documented
- [ ] Consent mechanisms work
- [ ] Deletion endpoint works
- [ ] Export endpoint works

### If HIPAA
- [ ] PHI identified and protected
- [ ] Access controls verified
- [ ] Audit logging enabled

### If SOC2
- [ ] Access controls documented
- [ ] Change management followed
- [ ] Incident response tested

### If PCI-DSS
- [ ] Cardholder data scoped
- [ ] Network segmented
- [ ] Encryption verified